 they're  craving for has to be just  another lockdown this time a national  lockdown period  no exceptions and biden can't admit this  we of course he can and the media is not  going to press him on it certainly for  any specifics of his solution  because they know it's not popular but  moving on  decoding the democrats on race  americans are in the streets demanding  racial justice  i think that the right thing to do for  our country moving forward  is to guarantee health care pay people a  living wage  support labor rights and make sure that  we're doing that with a lens of racial  and social  uh justice now is the time for racial  justice  okay what does racial justice mean i'll  tell you what it means it means  empowering groups that pretend to care  about minorities  but actually just end up profiting  themselves by stoking racial animosity  under abide administration decisions  will be made  largely based on race not on merit or  hard work or achievement  those words themselves remember come  from white privilege they're telling us  now  so get ready for massive discrimination  against i don't know more than 100  million americans  as special privileges accommodations and  money  are doled out to certain politically  preferred groups  and on foreign policy well democrats say  they're going to need to rebuild  all of our international relationships  the challenge  of following this disastrous presence  however  will not be just to restore the  reputation our credibility  it will be to enact a forward-looking  foreign policy  for the world as we find it today  translation get ready for another  apology tour biden is going to go around  the world  begging america's pardon after all  having a president who  actually fought for and fights for our  american workers  and is tough on trade he's not giving  away the store like obama did you think  the europeans like that  that's why a europe would probably love  a biden presidency  because they know he'll do pretty much  everything europe wants  and as far as china is concerned  remember biden said they weren't even a  threat  expected dismantling of all tariffs huge  concessions by the united states  and the continued outsourcing of  american jobs  oh what about health care well it's  still the old if you like your plan  you can keep it healthcare guaranteed as  human right  but taking away the right to have a  private plan if you want a private  plan i disagree with no okay but here's  here's a member of biden's own unity  health care tax  task force talking about how she and the  progressives  were able to move biden to the left  we did a lot of good work together to  really  push the vice president's health care  platform  much further than it's been before to  take elements of medicare for all  and put it into the platform  into the platform of course they mean  government-run health care they've  already embraced free healthcare for  illegal immigrants  and i think to really understand what's  in store for us  look no further than this chilling  account from the guardian newspaper  today it was written by a woman  with late stage cancer about her delayed  treatment from the national health  service  the operation finally took place on 27  february almost five months after the  cancer had recurred  once he'd taken a look inside my surgeon  closed me up again  with a heavy heart it was now impossible  to remove  all the cancerous tissue they got there  too late  it's a heartbreak on taxes  they're selling the same stale lines  i think we should raise taxes on the  wealthy pass a wealth tax  and protect our democracy let's help  millions of would-be entrepreneurs get  out from under their debts  so they can start businesses and it's  time  corporate america paid their fair share  of taxes  fair share translation it's back to the  failed policies of the 1970s  when the top marginal rates were 70 it's  not going to be just for corporations  and of course a tax rate that high just  hurts working men and women  wall street bankers and k street  lobbyists they can always find ways  around paying these exorbitant rates  but that's their plan to punish everyone  who works for a living  then dole out the money they have to  programs like i don't know let's go back  to midnight basketball  the tax policy center estimated that joe  biden's agenda would raise taxes  by four trillion dollars over the next  decade  more than twice as big as a tax raise as  proposed by hillary clinton  in 2016. and speaking of fairness  the rich already pay their fair share  check this out the average household in  the top  1 retains almost 18 times as much income  after taxes and transfer payments as the  bottom  fifth but pays more than 219  times as much in taxes  as we move through this campaign season  i'm going to be doing more decoding for  you but  i have to admit there are some people in  the democrat party  who really are saying what they mean  they were criticizing like why use the  word defund why use the word defund and  it's like this  is the word that's coming from the  streets this is about true reparations  our first responders have a role to play  in society  but they need to play a role in every  part of society we must begin the work  of dismantling the whole system of  oppression  wherever we find it well there's no  translation needed here  the they're actually telling the truth  they mean it when they say it  this is what they're planning they're  already doing it in places like  minneapolis and l.a  on most big issues of the past year the  squad  has been the democratic thought leader  from climate change to impeachment to  defunding the police  and they'll all continue to be key  influencers in a biden administration  you bet  and if you think biden is going to stop  them  you're you're just either naive or  haven't been paying any attention  biden will be nothing more than an oval  office bobble bobblehead  nodding along with whatever far leftists  appears before him at any given time  biden's no longer the moderate of yore  he's moved so far left to satiate the  mob that he'll have to continue doing so  or else  they're going to surround his new house  and then burn things around it until he  does  and do you think biden is going to call  up the national guard to protect  monuments or even the white house no way  they'll get them out through the tunnel  i'm confident  despite all of this despite all the  decoding we're going to have to do that  come fall many more americans will  understand the orwellian  chasm that you're going to get thrown  into  under a biden administration wouldn't  you rather be  decoding and exposing the radical agenda  than actually  living under it and that's the angle

